    LLM["LLM API<br/><i>OpenAI / Gemini / Ollama</i>"]

    UI ==>|"POST /chat"| APIts
    APIts ==> BCHAT
    BCHAT ==> MCHAT
    BCHAT <-->|history I/O| STORE
    SSR -.->|"GET /session, /profiles, /history"| BPROF
    BPROF <--> STORE

    CAM -.->|"WS video_frame<br/>every 200 ms"| WSH
    WSH --> VID --> FACE --> EMO --> EBUF

    MIC -.->|"WS audio_chunk<br/>on speech"| WSH
    WSH --> AUD --> STT --> TBUF

    MCHAT --> ER
    EBUF --> ER
    TBUF --> ER
    ER --> LR
    LR --> LLM

